Coverage alone helped a lot but CRAP is still above 12 for the CC-heavy functions (as predicted — CRAP ≤ 12 with CC=12+ requires ~100% coverage AND even then CC=13 at 100% → CRAP 13 > 12; CC=12 at 100% → exactly 12.0 ✓; CC=16 at 97.3% → 16.0 ✗).

Current state after Phase A:
